-### Resend safety
+`Fallback Payment Link Lifetime (Minutes)` is optional. Leave it blank/0 when you want provider-native behavior and the provider already controls expiry.
 
-Before resending a previously sent electronic payment link, Payment Hub refreshes provider status.
+### Retry safety
 
-A final or captured attempt is not supposed to be blindly resent.
