-The v0.6.8 issues around stale deleted draft invoices, Payment-Hub-unaware one-hour POSNext cleanup, expired-but-still-INITIATED payment links, and cross-shift captured-payment recovery were addressed by the v0.6.9/v0.6.11 maintenance line.
