-### Safe failed-refund retry
-
-A retry is available only for a definitively `Failed` refund. Before creating a replacement attempt, Payment Hub re-checks the old provider refund when the provider supports refund-status lookup. The original manager authorization remains bound to the same return/source/amount and the failed Gateway Transaction stays in history.
